            "html": "<h1>Habit tracker</h1>\n<ul id=\"has\" aria-label=\"What this tool does\"><li>Habits</li><li>Daily ticks</li><li>Streaks</li><li>Weekly chart</li><li>Notes</li></ul>\n<label for=\"entry\">New entry</label> <input id=\"entry\" type=\"text\">\n<ul id=\"items\" aria-label=\"Entries\"></ul>",
